{
 "duration": 35.396,
 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "Dumbbells were invented to be quiet.",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 2.183
  },
  {
   "text": "London, 1711.",
   "start": 2.719,
   "end": 3.162
  },
  {
   "text": "Joseph Addison wanted a bell ringer's workout.",
   "start": 3.408,
   "end": 7.73
  },
  {
   "text": "But bells are loud.",
   "start": 8.185,
   "end": 9.416
  },
  {
   "text": "So he built a bell with no bell.",
   "start": 9.742,
   "end": 11.595
  },
  {
   "text": "Rope and lead weights.",
   "start": 12.096,
   "end": 13.504
  },
  {
   "text": "Pull.",
   "start": 13.935,
   "end": 14.476
  },
  {
   "text": "Silence.",
   "start": 14.911,
   "end": 15.569
  },
  {
   "text": "Pull.",
   "start": 16.02,
   "end": 16.619
  },
  {
   "text": "Silence.",
   "start": 17.02,
   "end": 17.756
  },
  {
   "text": "A bell that can't ring is a dumb bell.",
   "start": 18.27,
   "end": 20.723
  },
  {
   "text": "The name stuck.",
   "start": 21.198,
   "end": 21.987
  },
  {
   "text": "You see, lowering a weight is like putting down a sleeping baby.",
   "start": 22.491,
   "end": 25.957
  },
  {
   "text": "Slow builds more muscle.",
   "start": 26.365,
   "end": 28.124
  },
  {
   "text": "So lower your dumbbells slowly.",
   "start": 28.457,
   "end": 30.502
  },
  {
   "text": "Dumbbells were born silent.",
   "start": 31.081,
   "end": 32.988
  },
  {
   "text": "Then gym guys started dropping them.",
   "start": 33.354,
   "end": 35.205
  }
 ]
}